## 5. External APIs and Cloud Services

DubbiOvi supports optional integrations with cloud AI providers (e.g., Google Gemini API via `@genkit-ai/google-genai`) and local server instances (e.g., Ollama LLM server).
- Access to external cloud APIs occurs solely through standard HTTP/REST network requests.
- No proprietary cloud server software, API backend code, or external service infrastructure is bundled or redistributed by DubbiOvi.

